<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Simple pricing</p>
  <h1>Money stays out of the swap.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every member can trade basic skills for free, always. Pro unlocks professionally taught courses and extra tools for people building a bigger teaching practice.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="plan">
      <p class="eyebrow">A fair place to start</p>
      <div class="plan-name">Free</div>
      <div class="plan-price">&#8377;0<span> / forever</span></div>
      <ul>
        <li>Unlimited skill-for-skill swaps</li>
        <li>Browse and message mentors</li>
        <li>Basic profile &amp; reviews</li>
        <li>Up to 2 active listings</li>
        <li>Access to all 8 free exchange skills</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/join?plan=Free" class="btn btn-outline">Join Free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plan pro">
      <span class="pro-ribbon">MOST POPULAR</span>
      <p class="eyebrow">For serious skill sharers &amp; learners</p>
      <div class="plan-name">Pro</div>
      <div class="plan-price">&#8377;499<span> / month</span></div>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything in Free</li>
        <li>Full access to <strong>Learn a New Skill</strong> — professionally taught, structured courses (Data Science, Photography, UI/UX, Digital Marketing)</li>
        <li>Unlimited listings &amp; categories</li>
        <li>Priority placement in search</li>
        <li>Verified mentor badge</li>
        <li>Group sessions &amp; scheduling tools</li>
        <li>Detailed swap analytics</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/join?plan=Pro" class="btn btn-coral">Join Pro</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pricing-note">
    <h3>Why do some skills need Pro?</h3>
    <p>Skills under <a href="/skills">Browse Skills</a> are community swaps — free, casual, peer-to-peer. Skills under <a href="/learn">Learn a New Skill</a> are structured, multi-week programs led by vetted working professionals, built for people who want a real, portfolio-ready outcome rather than a casual exchange. That level of instruction is what the &#8377;499/month Pro subscription covers.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
